{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07275","headline":"酬滁州李十六使君见赠 · 刘长卿","name":"酬滁州李十六使君见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满镜悲华发，空山寄此身。\n白云家自有，黄卷业长贫。\n嬾任垂竿老，狂因酿黍春。\n桃花迷圣代，桂树狎幽人。\n幢盖方临郡，柴荆忝作邻。\n但愁千骑至，石路却生尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}